Bharata declares the eldest must rule --- Bharata announces Daśaratha's death --- Rāma faints like a felled tree --- Rāma laments his absent last rites --- Rāma breaks the news to Sītā and Lakṣmaṇa --- Rāma offers water facing south at Mandākinī --- Rāma lays iṅgudī piṇḍa for his father --- Soldiers rush up and Rāma embraces grieving citizens